translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_c3786cda:

    # a "What's wrong?"
    a "怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_5d8ee48a:

    # e "Where are we going? Aren't we doing the training here?"
    e "我们要去哪儿？不是在这里训练吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_e359f166:

    # "You gesture at the archery training field."
    "你指了指射箭训练场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_5d1161e9:

    # a "Silly friend. Of course not. We're going to somewhere else for this special training. Come with me."
    a "傻朋友，当然不是。我们要去别的地方进行这次特别训练。跟我来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_36f80a9b:

    # "Amble walks away."
    "安布离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_83b7176c:

    # "He waves, greets and nods at everyone along the way. Dwarfed by his size, you follow silently behind Amble."
    "他一路上向遇到的每个人挥手、打招呼、点头致意。你被他的身形衬得格外渺小，默默跟在安布身后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_c0861881:

    # "You cannot help but admire the view before you."
    "你忍不住欣赏眼前的风景。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_72df042b:

    # "Amble's large ass swings and bounces with each of the bear's steps."
    "安布的大屁股随着这头熊的每一步摇摆、弹动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_4ebdad8d:

    # "You are reminded of what Jog said. Having a good view was a good perk when training with Amble."
    "有人提醒你乔格所说的话。在安布的训练中,有一个很好的景象是一个很好的享受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_c9b8cdaf:

    # "You have to agree."
    "你不得不承认。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_04a969ed:

    # "You two continues the journey in silence. You openly admiring Amble's assets from behind while Amble humming joyfully to himself."
    "你们继续沉默地赶路。安布在前方愉快地哼着歌，你从身后毫不掩饰地欣赏着他的身材。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_6e485cba:

    # "Finally, you arrive at the logging site."
    "终于，你们到了伐木场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_9d2dcd9c:

    # a "Here we are!"
    a "到了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_4007e1ff:

    # "You look around."
    "你环顾四周。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_bc196448:

    # "It is the same place as you trained with Amble last time."
    "跟你上次训练安布时一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_a1f996dc:

    # e "Why are we here?"
    e "我们为什么来这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_131ba3a8:

    # a "Because the lesson is related to the trees, silly."
    a "因为这堂课和树有关啊，傻瓜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_e9daa6d9:

    # "He looks at you as if that cannot be more obvious."
    "他看着你，仿佛这再明显不过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_69d6e974:

    # e "How can battle skill be related to trees?"
    e "战斗技巧怎么会和树有关？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_e9bdd514:

    # a "You can learn a lot from nature. I'll show you. But before that..."
    a "你能从大自然中学到很多。我会展示给你看。不过在那之前……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_03cd4f2b:

    # a "Let me just do this..."
    a "让我先做这件事……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_622c3bee:

    # "Amble strides up to you and starts to remove your armor."
    "安布大步走到你面前，开始脱你的盔甲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_77a11d01:

    # "The plates and shoulder pieces fall to the ground with heavy thuds."
    "甲片和护肩沉重地砸落在地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_18b3e9e0:

    # "Flustered, you try to stop Amble but he's much too strong."
    "急转直下,你想阻止安布 但他太强大了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_cf343cfe:

    # e "Am-Amble, what are you doing?"
    e "Am-安布,你在做什么?"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_dfa153eb:

    # a "I'm preparing you for the training of course!"
    a "当然是为了给训练做准备！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_11929dba:

    # "Amble explains as he continues to undress you."
    "安布解释他继续给你脱衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_81ebe667:

    # "What kind of training would require you to be naked?"
    "什么样的训练会要求你一丝不挂？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_1d99fdac:

    # "An answer pops up in your mind and your cheeks redden."
    "一个答案浮现在你的脑海中，你的脸颊红了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_7493f6af:

    # e "Am-Amble, I don't mind that kind of training but..."
    e "Am -安布,我不介意这样的训练,但是..."

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_4a8f3f66:

    # "Your fingers undo the straps of your armor as you say that."
    "你一边说着，一边解开盔甲上的带子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_c6554a81:

    # "Eventually, you find yourself standing in only your briefs."
    "最后，你发现自己只穿着内裤站在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_d274fe06:

    # "Just as you think Amble is going to strip you naked, he stops."
    "就像你认为安布会脱光你的衣服一样 他停止了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_bc890c5e:

    # a "Alright. We're ready!"
    a "好了。我们准备好了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_57379f5a:

    # "Amble straightens himself."
    "安布直立。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_981dca79:

    # "At that moment, you can't help but ask."
    "这时，你忍不住问道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_34767d57:

    # e "Amble, why am I only in my briefs?"
    e "安布,为什么我只穿短裤?"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_6c4e5b40:

    # a "This is an adventurer's training so of course, you have to look the part."
    a "这是冒险者的训练，所以当然得穿得像个冒险者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_cc64560c:

    # a "That's what Jog told me."
    a "乔格就是这么告诉我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_d8453bb0:

    # a "Why do you think I go around dressed the way I am?"
    a "你觉得我为什么总是穿成这样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_4d901698:

    # "Amble flashes you a bright grin like that's the most logical thing in the world."
    "安布朝你露出灿烂的笑容，仿佛这是世上最合乎逻辑的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_d8b48ff4:

    # "You do not know how to argue with that logic. It makes both no sense and absolute sense."
    "你不知道该怎么反驳这套逻辑。它既毫无道理，又完全说得通。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_cf28f725:

    # e "But why take off the other parts of the armor?"
    e "可为什么要把盔甲的其他部分也脱掉？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_1d642d4c:

    # "Amble rummages at the back of his briefs and soon pulls something out."
    "安布在内裤后面摸索了一阵，很快掏出一样东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_9f55e2c7:

    # a "This is for you."
    a "这个给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_0ee48921:

    # "Amble opens his paw and you see what he is offering you."
    "安布打开他的爪子,你看他给你什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_75fdec74:

    # "It is the briefs from Rahim's adventurer outfit. Just the briefs."
    "这是雷希姆冒险家服装的简介 只是简介。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_6fb6bdc2:

    # e "Erm... Why?"
    e "呃……为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_0e5f7402:

    # "Amble looks as confused as you are."
    "安布脸上的困惑不亚于你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_ada30d41:

    # e "I mean... What am I supposed to do with this?"
    e "我的意思是……我该拿它做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_f6ebbe57:

    # a "Put it on of course! What else can you do with it"
    a "当然是穿上啊！不然还能拿来做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_84c364d4:

    # e "Again... Why?"
    e "还是……为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_6c4e5b40_1:

    # a "This is an adventurer's training so of course, you have to look the part."
    a "这是冒险者的训练，所以当然得穿得像个冒险者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_cc64560c_1:

    # a "That's what Jog told me."
    a "乔格就是这么告诉我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_d8453bb0_1:

    # a "Why do you think I go around dressed the way I am?"
    a "你觉得我为什么总是穿成这样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_4d901698_1:

    # "Amble flashes you a bright grin like that's the most logical thing in the world."
    "安布朝你露出灿烂的笑容，仿佛这是世上最合乎逻辑的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_d8b48ff4_1:

    # "You do not know how to argue with that logic. It makes both no sense and absolute sense."
    "你不知道该怎么反驳这套逻辑。它既毫无道理，又完全说得通。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_d8703e59:

    # a "Hurry up."
    a "快点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_883cbf69:

    # "Amble tosses you the briefs."
    "安布把内裤扔给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_17e5f132:

    # a "Also when I asked Rahim to loan this to me, I told him about that it's for a special training I'm doing with you."
    a "当我让雷希姆借给我这个时 我告诉他这是给你做特别训练用的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_99f0fed5:

    # a "Rahim told me that we better not tear it. Not sure what he means by that, but you better be careful, puny friend."
    a "雷希姆告诉我,我们最好不要撕裂它, 不知道他的意思是什么, 但你最好小心,小朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_414fc3a2:

    # "You are not quite sure what to feel from that information."
    "你不太确定自己该作何感想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_025f9fb5:

    # "In any case, the briefs are still warm from being wedged in Amble's clothes."
    "无论如何,书状仍然很暖和,不会被安布的衣服缠住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_55144e1c:

    # "As you put the briefs on, you find that to be quite sexy."
    "你穿上内裤，发现这感觉相当刺激。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_f61f1a50:

    # e "Why only the briefs?"
    e "为什么只有内裤？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_a07dab3c:

    # a "If you have any iron parts on during the training, they'll cut into you. You'll hurt."
    a "训练时如果身上有铁制部件，它们会嵌进你的身体。你会受伤的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_547a4591:

    # a "We don't want that."
    a "我们可不想那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_4cb5765c:

    # e "Okay..."
    e "好吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_b03194de:

    # "That makes sense..."
    "这倒也说得通……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_63ba9289:

    # a "Come. It's time for training."
    a "来吧。训练时间到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_c4c43b72:

    # "Dressed in only your briefs, you follow Amble to a big tree."
    "你穿着短裤,跟着安布到一棵大树上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_23735f7c:

    # a "Puny friend, how do you cut down this tree with just one swing?"
    a "小不点，你要怎么只挥一斧就砍倒这棵树？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_9ae48b57:

    # "Amble asks as he taps the sturdy tree beside him."
    "当他敲打他旁边的坚固的树时,安布问他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_2cb91bd7:

    # e "I... I have no idea."
    e "我……我不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_a59b6c9a:

    # a "Puny friend, you're lucky cause I'm going to teach you that."
    a "小不点，你真幸运，因为我要教你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_be011780:

    # "Really?"
    "真的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_eb66b43a:

    # "Honestly, that sounds quite amazing."
    "说真的，听起来很厉害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_56c9eea7:

    # a "Course. Why else are we here?"
    a "当然。不然我们来这里干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_fd24b978:

    # "Amble stands before the tree and examines it for a few seconds."
    "安布站到树前，观察了几秒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_10d02d0a:

    # "Then, he swings his axe hard into the trunk. The axe cuts about halfway through the trunk."
    "然后，他用力把斧头砍进树干。斧头砍进了大约一半的树干。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_9e34e97f:

    # "However, the tree remains unmoved."
    "然而，树却纹丝不动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_105c8c84:

    # e "Amble, you sure..."
    e "安布,你肯定..."

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_181ff7c6:

    # "Amble wiggles his axe that is lodged in the tree. The canopy rustles as the axe opens up the wound."
    "安布扭动卡在树里的斧头，随着斧刃撕开伤口，树冠沙沙作响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_9d7c4a01:

    # "The tree starts to sway before your eyes."
    "树开始在你眼前摇晃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_8c2f189a:

    # "Soon, Amble has opened up a large gap. With a chip in its large trunk, the tree loses its foundation and begins to tip."
    "安布很快打开了一个巨大的缺口。 树干里有一个芯片,树就失去了根基,开始倒塌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_029fb406:

    # a "Hng!"
    a "哼！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_d0f24406:

    # "Amble pulls his axe out with a grunt."
    "安布闷哼一声拔出斧头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_5dab7443:

    # "The tree keels over from its own weight. As it lands, the forest ground trembles."
    "树自身的重量让它向一侧倒下。落地时，森林的地面都震颤起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_ffb9abb9:

    # "You are gobsmacked."
    "你目瞪口呆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_643b3b81:

    # a "How about that."
    a "怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_22095138:

    # e "That... that's amazing."
    e "这……这太厉害了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_dec893b9:

    # e "How did you do it, Amble?"
    e "你是怎么做到的,安布?"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_030329dc:

    # a "I'll teach you."
    a "我会教你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_348413f6:

    # a "This is something I've picked up from being a lumberjack."
    a "这是我当伐木工时学会的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_2f6baa09:

    # a "There's a core to every tree and once it is weakened, it'll be easier for you to make it fall."
    a "每棵树都有树心，只要削弱它，就更容易让树倒下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_4685b410:

    # a "The same can be applied to enemies."
    a "敌人也一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_381f206f:

    # a "Only need to find the core."
    a "只要找到他们的核心就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_f7621ca4:

    # e "How does one do that?"
    e "要怎么做？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_af4e086b:

    # a "It's easy. Our core is around our belly button."
    a "很简单。我们的核心就在肚脐附近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_987e3d37:

    # e "Really?"
    e "真的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_992139af:

    # "You find that rather hard to believe."
    "你觉得这实在难以置信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_77a4061f:

    # a "I'll show you."
    a "我来给你看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_148e3149:

    # "Amble takes quick steps towards you. Before you can react, he hits you as soft as he can around your lower stomach."
    "安布朝你快速前进,在你反应之前,他打你的时候, 比你的下腹软。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_8432e069:

    # "It doesn't hurt that much but you are assaulted by a sense of vertigo."
    "这不算太疼，但一阵眩晕感袭来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_004332a0:

    # e "Ahh..."
    e "啊……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_b39538ae:

    # "The world spins and there is a fleeting moment where you feel like falling."
    "天旋地转，你短暂地感觉自己就要倒下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_47ca5707:

    # "It's like the wind has been knocked out of you."
    "感觉像是肺里的空气都被打了出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_20459b99:

    # "You land on the floor with your back. There is a slight buzz and when you look up, the sunlight are shining through the canopy of the forest."
    "你背部着地摔在地上。脑中嗡的一声，你抬起头，看见阳光透过森林的树冠洒下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_befc87b0:

    # e "Oof."
    e "呃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_d4781850:

    # a "Puny friend, that is wild. If this is what I get from teaching you new skills, feel free to come find me whenever you want."
    a "小不点，这感觉真狂野。如果教你新技能会得到这样的回报，你随时都可以来找我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_d30d9b98:

    # e "Hmm... Hmm... Yes."
    e "嗯……嗯……对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_135c1d6a:

    # "With the taste of Amble's cum on your lips and the scent of his musk in your mind, you slowly drift off."
    "你嘴唇上沾着安布精液的味道 脑海中他口香的气味 慢慢地飘走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ole_Training_Scene_32360cc6:

    # "That... was an amazing training."
    "这……真是一次精彩的训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_2dedfb7c:

    # e "How is the life in Lusterfield?"
    e "乐斯民菲尔德的生活如何?"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_88fdc460:

    # a "The town is wonderful. Many fine people here. And I know most of them, so you've come to the right people to ask about this!"
    a "镇子很棒。这里有很多好人。我认识其中大多数，所以你来问我就对了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_1e96fc0d:

    # a "Was raised a logger. So I've helped built most of the buildings in the town. Picked up the craft from dad."
    a "我从小就跟着爸爸当伐木工。所以镇里大多数建筑都是我帮忙建的，这门手艺也是跟爸爸学的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_3f04151d:

    # "Amble's eyes dim a bit at the mention of his father but then he perks up again."
    "提到父亲时，安布的眼神黯淡了些，但很快又重新振作起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_6fbdc346:

    # e "How is the Tavern?"
    e "酒馆怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_8c73a502:

    # a "Cane at the tavern is more ancient than you might expect. He's already keeping the tavern running when I was a mere cub."
    a "酒馆里的凯恩比你想象的还要年长。他在我还只是一只小熊崽时，就已经在经营酒馆了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_9e14003f:

    # a "Rahim is amazing. He packs a mean punch. No one else in town can beat me in an arm wrestle but Rahim. But I've learned a lot from him."
    a "雷希姆很了不起,他打得狠,除了雷希姆以外 镇上除了雷希姆,没人能击败我,但我从他那里学到了很多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_e5961362:

    # a "It's doubly amazing that he can refine his strength into something as delicate as tailoring."
    a "更令人惊叹的是，他竟然能把自己的力量锤炼成裁缝这样细腻的手艺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_77ead26b:

    # a "Can you imagine me at a sewing table? Haha."
    a "你能想象我坐在缝纫台前吗？哈哈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_37592623:

    # e "What about the shop?"
    e "那商店呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_befee3d3:

    # a "Ole is very kind. You wouldn't think so but accidents happen more often than you think during logging."
    a "奥利人很好,你不会这么认为 但事故发生频率比伐木时要高。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_be9629f4:

    # "Large falling woods and a giant axe? Recipe for disaster."
    "大树倒下加上一把巨斧？这简直是灾难配方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_30f13181:

    # a "Ole has patched me up many times."
    a "奥利帮我包扎过很多次。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_cc265291:

    # a "Used to be quite close to Sebas."
    a "我以前和塞巴斯关系很亲近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_bcda57e5:

    # a "But ever since Lot formed a group with Jog and me, He would give us the evil eyes from time to time."
    a "但自从洛哥把我和乔格组成一队后，他就时不时用那种阴沉的眼神看我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_937703a1:

    # "Amble frowns."
    "安布皱起眉头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lusterfield_400e88ee:

    # a "Jog told me that I was imagining it. Perhaps he's right."
    a "乔格告诉我那只是我的想象。也许他说得对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_How_Doing_2400df22:

    # e "How are you doing, Amble?"
    e "你好吗,安布?"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_How_Doing_1c4c838e:

    # a "Not doing much."
    a "没做什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_How_Doing_1db603d1:

    # a "Just hanging out with Jog and working on the anvil."
    a "就是和乔格待在一起，顺便在铁砧上干活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_How_Doing_c75f36e5:

    # a "Ironing out the kinks in the armor and sharpening the blade."
    a "修整盔甲的毛刺，再把刀刃磨利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_How_Doing_00633eca:

    # a "But honestly, I'm just waiting for night to come so the real fun starts at the tavern."
    a "不过说实话，我只是在等夜幕降临，好去酒馆开始真正的快乐时光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lothar_2097b8f6:

    # e "How about Lothar?"
    e "洛萨尔怎么样?"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lothar_a1c5eca7:

    # a "He's my role model and he should be yours too."
    a "他是我的榜样，也应该成为你的榜样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lothar_6b2c2279:

    # a "Jog and I weren't in the best shape when Lot found us."
    a "洛哥找到我和乔格时，我们的状况可不太好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lothar_3e55750b:

    # a "He was the one who helped us get clean clothes, food. After what went down with the goats."
    a "是他帮我们弄到干净的衣服和食物。那时山羊的事情刚刚发生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lothar_8186b1fc:

    # a "We owed him a lot."
    a "我们欠他的太多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lothar_aa474a85:

    # e "Why do you like him so much?"
    e "你为什么这么喜欢他？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lothar_6b56ea75:

    # a "He is a simple man, if you treat him well, you'll be treated the same way."
    a "他是个简单的人。只要你对他好，他也会同样对你好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lothar_b4e4aed5:

    # a "And I love simple stuff. Life doesn't have to be all complicated if you'd just take it easy."
    a "而且我喜欢简单的东西。只要放轻松，生活没必要搞得那么复杂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lothar_c49f352b:

    # a "That's how I see things."
    a "我就是这么看待事情的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lothar_815bfb88:

    # e "Was it Lothar's idea that you two are taking care of the road?"
    e "是洛萨尔的想法 你们两个在照顾道路?"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lothar_5ba5a265:

    # a "After that incident with the goat's wagon, we thought we needed a better road protection."
    a "山羊的马车出事后，我们觉得需要更好地保护道路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lothar_f687201f:

    # a "Plus, Lot got a lot of gold from his reputation in the village, he just gifted them to us to help killing monsters."
    a "而且洛哥凭着在村里的声望赚了不少金子，他把金子都送给我们，让我们帮忙消灭怪物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Lothar_8a876d19:

    # a "We just wanted to keep the area around Lusterfield safe for travellers like you."
    a "我们只是想保持乐斯民菲尔德周围地区的安全 像你这样的旅行者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Jog_192662ed:

    # a "I like the puny little thing."
    a "我喜欢那个小不点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Jog_dcb06a63:

    # a "We're complete opposites but that's probably why we work so good together."
    a "我们完全相反，但也许正因为如此，我们才能配合得这么好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Jog_099a6a6e:

    # a "Lot keeps telling me that I have the tendency to charge into the battle. It's a bad habit I have to kick. Have no idea how."
    a "洛哥总说我老是冲进战场。这是我必须改掉的坏习惯，但我完全不知道该怎么改。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Jog_da076756:

    # a "Therefore. I'm always caught in a pickle. Jog has saved my ass so many times now with his great scouting and archery skills."
    a "所以我总是陷入困境。乔格凭着出色的侦察和射箭技巧，已经救过我很多次了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Jog_2f59ebc3:

    # a "I'm glad to know that he has my back."
    a "知道他会在我身后支持我，我很高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Jog_d58dfe05:

    # a "I have his too."
    a "我也会支持他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_a2c06dc8:

    # e "Hey, Amble, I've been wondering about something for a while."
    e "嘿,安布,我一直在想 某事有一段时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_85d9118a:

    # e "When I helped you with the landsharks, you mentioned patrolling the farms regularly."
    e "上次我帮你们对付陆鲨时，你提到会定期巡查农场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_6345b002:

    # "Amble is looking at you quizzically."
    "安布在看你的测验。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_48942efa:

    # a "Yeah, I patrol the farms regularly. Is everything alright, puny friend?"
    a "对，我会定期巡查农场。怎么了，小不点？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_3eb93e31:

    # e "Well, nobody else seems to visit the farmland much... I was wondering if you knew why that was?"
    e "嗯，似乎没什么别人会经常去农田……我想知道你知不知道为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_49a2e909:

    # a "Ah, I see now."
    a "啊，我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_2f0662d6:

    # "A goofy smile spreads across his face."
    "他脸上露出憨憨的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_118964c1:

    # a "Well, the farmland is pretty peaceful. It's one of the few places the goats haven't attacked, and there aren't any tribes in that direction, as far as we know."
    a "农田那边很平静。那是山羊没有攻击过的少数地方之一，而且据我们所知，那个方向也没有部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_202c2d18:

    # a "So, Lot sees it as beneath him."
    a "所以，洛哥觉得那地方不值得他去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_e0bf6a30:

    # "You look over to your right, where Jog is lazing about."
    "你看向右边，乔格正懒洋洋地待在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_136fc8ef:

    # e "And Jog?"
    e "那乔格呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_e3d23c9a:

    # j "What am I going to do, sneak around and listen to the wheat? A scout is useful against groups of people, not the enemies of farms."
    j "我还能做什么？偷偷摸摸地绕来绕去，听小麦说话吗？侦察兵对付一群人时才有用，对农场里的敌人可没用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_14906c69:

    # "Amble's smile is warm and genuine, like a warm hug."
    "安布的笑容是温暖和真实的 就像一个温暖的拥抱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_677495d2:

    # a "So that's why it falls to me to take care of them!"
    a "所以只好由我来处理了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_5b9d8d25:

    # e "Isn't it a lot of work to take care of that big an area though?"
    e "不过，照看那么大一片区域，不会很辛苦吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_cba13866:

    # "The bear scratches underneath his chin, as if in deep thought."
    "那头熊挠了挠下巴，仿佛陷入沉思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_865ee4ac:

    # a "I never thought about it!"
    a "我从没想过这个问题！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_6101e73c:

    # a "I guess it does get to be a bit much sometimes."
    a "我想有时候确实会有点忙不过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_58b2b611:

    # "He laughs merrily."
    "他开心地笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_b0ac769c:

    # a "Not that it's ever too much for me. The only real issue I have is that my patrols sometimes have to go into the night."
    a "倒也没到让我吃不消的程度。真正的问题是，我有时得巡查到晚上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_9b948e85:

    # e "...How do you patrol in the dark. You can't see, and I know your other senses aren't that good."
    e "……你在黑暗中怎么巡查？你又看不见，而且我知道你的其他感官也没那么敏锐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_048d4769:

    # a "Well, I can't do all of the things I'm asked to do during my rounds, but I can reduce monster populations."
    a "嗯，我没法在巡查时把所有要求都完成，但我能减少怪物的数量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_87e1592f:

    # e "Do you have a special strategy or something?"
    e "你有什么特殊策略之类的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_3b948bff:

    # "You get a well meaning shrug from the man."
    "那人给了你一个善意的耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_2728f0e5:

    # a "Not really. I just wait for a landshark to bite my leg, and then I punch it very hard."
    a "没什么。我只要等陆鲨咬我的腿，然后狠狠揍它一顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_39293c58:

    # a "Problem solved."
    a "问题解决。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_970eb8cd:

    # e "I'm not going to address that."
    e "我不打算对此发表评论。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_9a09f01c:

    # e "You have other tasks on patrol other than landsharks?"
    e "除了陆鲨，你巡查时还要处理其他事情吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_f3d5b5c6:

    # a "Of course! There are all sorts of things that need taking care of over there."
    a "当然！那边有各种各样的事情等着处理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_5c5e9223:

    # "Amble wraps an arm around your neck and grinds his fist into your hair, giving you a noogie. It doesn't hurt, but your hair is a mess now."
    "安布用胳膊搂住你的脖子，用拳头揉乱你的头发，给你来了个揉头。并不疼，但你的头发现在乱糟糟的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_02da319d:

    # a "I just had a great idea!"
    a "我想到个好主意！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_8a21b579:

    # a "Why don't I just {i}show{/i} you what I do out there!"
    a "我为什么不直接{i}展示{/i}给你看我在外面做什么！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_608b27c1:

    # "Amble's voice hurts at this range, but his good mood is infectious."
    "安布的声音在这范围很痛 但他的心情是传染性的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_fefd98da:

    # a "Are you coming with me?" nointeract
    a "你要和我一起去吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_a703f702:

    # e "I don't see why not. Sounds like it could be fun!"
    e "我想不出理由拒绝。听起来可能会很有趣！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_2e87efa6:

    # a "Almost as fun as the last time I took you somewhere."
    a "几乎和上次我带你去的地方一样有趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_3ee2496e:

    # "Amble isn't teasing you when he says this, it's a statement of fact to him, it seems. Remembering your special training with Amble makes you flush with embarrassment, a feeling Amble seems immune to."
    "他说这话并不是在逗你，对他来说似乎只是陈述事实。想起你和安布的特别训练，你羞得脸红，而安布似乎完全不受影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_d5c7bd07:

    # e "Well..."
    e "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_48761336:

    # "Amble's arm tightens around you slightly, cutting you off."
    "安布的手臂紧紧在你身边 稍微拉紧了,切断了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_c09dfe48:

    # a "Maybe not this time, little one. A bit too public out in the fields!"
    a "这次可能不行，小家伙。田野里太公开了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_8d51cd8e:

    # a "I have a reputation to uphold."
    a "我得维护自己的名声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_cae40ea4:

    # "The wink Amble gives you leaves you confused as to whether or not he means what he's saying."
    "安布给你的闪烁让你困惑 他是否意味着他所说的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_a35daf2b:

    # "It's probably best to assume he's being serious."
    "最好还是相信他是认真的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_35e4352d:

    # a "I won't say no to some other time though."
    a "不过，改天来点别的，我倒不会拒绝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_5854a2a6:

    # "Just when you think you're free from teasing, you're suddenly struck with another attempt."
    "你正以为自己终于躲过调侃，突然又迎来一次袭击。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_0dfc5bdb:

    # "The worst part is, you're pretty sure he doesn't even mean to tease you. He's being entirely honest, and accidentally messing with your heart."
    "最糟的是，你很确定他甚至不是故意逗你。他完全是发自真心，却无意间撩拨着你的心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_9e8781d2:

    # e "...okay, it's good to know there might be another time, honestly."
    e "……好吧，说实话，知道以后还有机会也不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_b18a4c25:

    # "You mumble that to yourself under your breath. Thankfully, Amble is distracted enough by his excitement not to notice."
    "幸好安布的兴奋已经分散了注意力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_4fa1983f:

    # e "When do you want to go out and show me?"
    e "你想什么时候带我出去见识一下？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_f29b3043:

    # "Amble gives you a carefree shrug."
    "安布无忧无虑地耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_e0652732:

    # a "Whenever you're free. Give me the word and I'll bring you along for one of my patrols."
    a "你有空的时候都行。告诉我一声，我就带你去巡查。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_9d2f2d12:

    # e "Alright."
    e "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_02c4df3f:

    # e "Now?"
    e "现在？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_79745361:

    # a "Oh? Are you not available now, puny friend?"
    a "哦？小不点，你现在没空吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_9b0b9376:

    # "Amble lets go of you."
    "安布放你走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_b39467dd:

    # e "I've just recalled, I've got something else to do."
    e "我刚想起来，我还有别的事要做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_aac5625a:

    # a "Of course, no need to explain yourself."
    a "当然，不用解释。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_f29b3043_1:

    # "Amble gives you a carefree shrug."
    "安布无忧无虑地耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Quest_770c9947:

    # a "Good luck on your something else, [e]. You can come back any time if you wanna visit the farm."
    a "祝你忙别的事顺利，[e]。想来农场参观，随时都可以回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_436731b3:

    # e "Amble! I'm ready to go on the patrol with you."
    e "安布！我准备好和你一起巡查了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_088aff47:

    # "Amble looks up at you with a smile, getting up while rolling his shoulders and popping his neck."
    "安布笑着看着你 抬起肩膀 扭断脖子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_b4165890:

    # a "Ah, it is good to see you excited to come, puny friend."
    a "啊，很高兴看到你这么期待，小不点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_7a8fe5db:

    # a "You're the first person to actually take an interest in what happens out in the farmlands."
    a "你是第一个真正对农田发生的事感兴趣的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_ef859b93:

    # "The jolly giant seems not at all bothered by this fact, though he does seem happy to see you."
    "不过，这位快乐的巨人似乎一点也不介意，反而很高兴见到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_7a0ab94f:

    # "Then again, he tends to look happy to see anybody."
    "话说回来，他见到谁似乎都很高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_90e7d5bd:

    # e "I can't imagine why. It's not like there aren't any threats out there."
    e "我实在想不出为什么。外面又不是没有威胁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_a6ee2ffe:

    # "Amble scratches the back of his neck for a moment."
    "安布挠了挠后颈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_36d980be:

    # a "Yeah, well, they say the people are boring and talk too much, and that they're too dumb to have a conversation with."
    a "嗯，他们都说那些人无聊又话多，蠢得连聊天都不会，而他们觉得我正合适。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_277c1358:

    # a "Needless to say, they think I'm a great fit."
    a "不用说，他们觉得我再合适不过了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_568339bd:

    # "Amble throws you a playful wink. It seems he's aware of his reputation. It's hard to believe that it doesn't make him upset, but his face betrays no hint of that."
    "安布顽皮地朝你眨了眨眼。他似乎知道自己的名声。很难相信这不会让他难过，但他的脸上没有露出丝毫迹象。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_e87c3183:

    # e "Maybe I'm a good fit too, who knows."
    e "也许我也很合适，谁知道呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_cb0bf12f:

    # "Amble laughs, slapping you on the back hard enough to send you stumbling."
    "安布大笑起来，重重拍了拍你的后背，力道大得让你踉跄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_7e394b17:

    # a "I think you will! The farmers will like you at the very least. Your efforts with the landsharks haven't gone unnoticed."
    a "我觉得你会！至少农民们会喜欢你。你对付陆鲨的努力可没有被忽视。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_537d0057:

    # "The statement catches you off guard, a blush coloring your face."
    "这句话让你措手不及，脸上泛起红晕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_dade9fba:

    # e "Really? I thought nobody saw me out there..."
    e "真的吗？我还以为没人看见我在那边……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_73862874:

    # "At this point, Amble's eyes are twinkling with mirth as he thinks on conversations he's had with farmers."
    "此时此刻,安布的双眼正与欢乐交织在一起 因为他在思考和农民的谈话时。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_cc4c5887:

    # a "Oh yes, the rumormill has been filled with stories about you. Everyone wants to know who the handsome young dragon is."
    a "当然！关于你的传闻已经传遍了。大家都想知道那个英俊的年轻龙人是谁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_e9cd7c70:

    # e "They really call me handsome?"
    e "他们真的说我英俊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_c291beb3:

    # "Amble shrugs slightly."
    "安布微微耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_ed387567:

    # a "Sometimes, though they mainly say it when they call you 'a little too handsome for your own good.' Your flirting has apparently given a few farmers quite the show!"
    a "有时候吧，不过他们主要是在说你“帅得有点过头了”。看来你的调情让几个农民大饱眼福！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_8d69e72c:

    # "Even if you didn't flirt against every enemy you fought, it's a little embarrassing to think of how many random people may have caught sight of your actions."
    "就算你没有对战斗过的每个敌人都调情，想到可能有多少路人看到了你的举动，还是有点尴尬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_141b5167:

    # "...Even if the idea turns you on a little."
    "……尽管这个想法还是让你有点兴奋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_3e4cb8a4:

    # e "Ehem. Well. We should head out, yes?"
    e "咳。嗯。我们该出发了，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_8bd58a00:

    # "Amble throws his head back in a hearty laugh before leading you off towards the farmlands."
    "安布仰头发出爽朗的大笑，然后带你朝农田走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_779f4b6b:

    # a "As you wish, puny friend. We'll see if old Arthur will mention you like he did last time. Try not to run too far if he does."
    a "如你所愿，小不点。看看老亚瑟会不会像上次那样提到你。要是他真提了，你可别跑太远。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_ea44f960:

    # a "I don't want to have to spend half of my patrol chasing after you."
    a "我可不想花掉半个巡查时间去追你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_b090ca65:

    # "You act like you don't hear Amble, trying to move on with your life as soon as possible."
    "你表现得好像你听不到安布的声音 试图尽快过上你的生活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_51dad4eb:

    # "You follow after Amble for a bit. It's easy to see why some of the farmers around here pay extra attention to the people fighting landsharks."
    "你跟着安布一阵子,很容易明白为什么这里的农民 特别关心那些与土地开发者抗争的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_a5248884:

    # "Amble's ass isn't exactly well hidden, what with the skimpy gear he always wears around."
    "安布总穿着那身清凉装备，他的屁股实在藏不住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_afaee3da:

    # a "So, Puny friend."
    a "所以，小不点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_baf6c83c:

    # "Amble shocks you out of the meditative state his ass had lured you into."
    "安布把你从他的屁股引诱出的冥想状态中惊醒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_1a2adcc2:

    # a "Other than Landsharks, what are the main dangers you can find in the farmlands?"
    a "除了陆鲨，农田里还能遇到的主要危险是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_ba97d75e:

    # e "Umm... There aren't exactly many, but I'd say the scarecrows."
    e "呃……其实没多少，不过我觉得是稻草人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_7f12857d:

    # "Amble's ambling pace picks up a bit as your words put some pep in his step, for some reason."
    "安布的摇摆步调加快了一点 就像你的话让他的脚步有些震动, 不知何故。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_e71ca707:

    # a "The scarecrows around here are a little {i}too{/i} good at scaring away scarecrows and the like sometimes."
    a "这里的稻草人有时在吓走乌鸦之类的东西方面，{i}实在{/i}太厉害了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_2588546b:

    # e "They're a lot like Lothar's dummy."
    e "他们跟洛萨尔的假人很像。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_d38ea768:

    # "Amble suddenly halts, turning to look at you."
    "安布突然停下，转身看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_1b7b666e:

    # a "I never really thought about that. I wonder if he teaches them too?"
    a "我还真没想过这个。我想知道他是不是也会教它们？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_70f086a9:

    # "What does he mean by teach? Can you even teach cloth?"
    "他说的“教”是什么意思？布料也能教吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_f98d506e:

    # e "What do you mean, teach."
    e "你说教是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_aa5194d5:

    # "Amble gives you a quizzical look."
    "安布给你一个测验的表情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_3365aa99:

    # a "Why, our first stop of cousre!"
    a "当然是我们的第一站！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_9081b0d1:

    # a "We're going to teach one of the newly made scarecrows how to scare crows. And also maybe landsharks."
    a "我们要教一只新做的稻草人怎么吓跑乌鸦。说不定还能教它对付陆鲨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_861e64e6:

    # a "I've been working on that last one for a while. They're not particularly good at wielding axes."
    a "最后这个我已经琢磨一阵子了。它们不太擅长挥斧头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_e98d449b:

    # e "Where and how exactly are we going to be doing this?"
    e "我们到底要在哪里、怎么做？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_b88b3070:

    # "Amble looks slightly confused about your questions, as if thes should be things you know already."
    "安布对你的问题感到有些困惑，仿佛这些本来都是你该知道的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_343ab56e:

    # a "Where? That farmhouse over there."
    a "哪里？就是那边的农舍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_016794fc:

    # "Amble points to a distant farmhouse sitting cozily in the wheat fields."
    "安布指向远处麦田里一座舒适的农舍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_2a0e7d4a:

    # "Well, not that the farmlands only have wheat. It's just the predominant plant."
    "当然，农田里也不只有小麦，只是小麦占了大多数。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_6f33f4db:

    # a "How? Well, same way you teach anything really, by showing it."
    a "怎么教？当然是教任何东西都一样，把它示范给它看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_cd5d701e:

    # a "Same way I taught you how to strike the core."
    a "就像我教你攻击核心那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_2e4c51a1:

    # "You smirk at that. He's handed an opportunity for revenge to you on a silver platter."
    "你对此露出一抹坏笑。他把一个复仇的机会拱手送到了你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_edc905ca:

    # e "So you're going to suck is dick?"
    e "所以你要含他的鸡巴？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_876ce0f6:

    # "Amble looks at you, completely bewildered."
    "安布完全困惑地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_00549cc8:

    # a "No? Why would we. What does that have anything to do with training."
    a "不？为什么要？这和训练有什么关系？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_4e866d02:

    # e "Wha- bu-"
    e "什、什——"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_fd79c36d:

    # a "Plus, it's not like scarecrows even have dicks. You say the craziest things sometime, puny friend!"
    a "再说，稻草人根本没有鸡巴。你有时真会说些稀奇古怪的话，小不点！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_c69152e0:

    # "He has to be fucking with you. There's no way this man is serious."
    "他一定是在逗你。这个人不可能是认真的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_4db96756:

    # "You'll go along with it, just in case."
    "你决定先顺着他，保险起见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_f3366ddc:

    # e "Yeah, haha. I sure do!"
    e "对，哈哈。我确实会！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_3819d919:

    # a "See, like that! Why would you agree with me."
    a "看吧，就是这样！你干吗同意我的话？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_6622efe8:

    # "It's for the best if you just follow him for now."
    "现在还是跟着他比较好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_e09a6557:

    # "Looking at your destination, it's quite a bit closer than when Amble first pointed it out. You crossed a considerable distance while talking to him."
    "看着你的目的地,它比安布第一次指出时要近一点。你跟他说话时越过了很远的距离。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_10b4f6ac:

    # "Time flies when you're having fun, or... whatever it is you have with Amble. It's tough to know what to think of him. It's like he's constantly switching between two modes, and it's hard to keep up."
    "和安布待在一起时，时间总是过得很快；不过，你们之间究竟算是什么关系呢？他仿佛总在两种状态之间来回切换，让人很难跟上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_45fb9cac:

    # "It's only a few more minutes before you can start to make out individual elements of the farmhouse Amble is taking you too."
    "再过几分钟 你就能开始 确定安布农庄的个别元素 也把你带走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_f8b56267:

    # "It's larger than you thought, its rich wooden walls reaching two floors up. From what Amble tells you, it also goes one floor down."
    "它比你想的要大,它有丰富的木墙 达到两层楼。从安布告诉你的,它也下一层。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_0fbfdc03:

    # "Not the biggest farm you've seen, but it could comfortably host a family with room to spare."
    "这不是你见过最大的农场，但住下一家人还绰绰有余。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_5ab0c3bb:

    # "As you finally bring your gaze towards the front of the farm, you see someone on the porch gently rocking in their rocking chair, a cigar in his hand."
    "当你终于把目光移向农场正面时，看见有人在门廊上坐在摇椅里轻轻摇晃，手里夹着一支雪茄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_96c9bdb0:

    # "He seems to be some sort of Shepherd -- old, from the looks of things. Despite that, the man looks full of life."
    "看样子他是个牧羊人——从外表看年纪很大。尽管如此，这人看起来仍然充满活力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_0ad18a1e:

    # "The two of you spot each other at the same time. An excited grin spreads across the farmer's face as he waits patiently for the two of you to approach."
    "你们俩同时发现了对方。农民脸上绽开兴奋的笑容，耐心等着你们走近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_4878ee52:

    # a "Hello Mr. Arthur!"
    a "你好，亚瑟先生！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_d5601cb1:

    # "'Mr. Arthur's' smile morphs into a look of slightly irritated confusion."
    "“亚瑟先生”的笑容变成了略带恼火的困惑表情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_91e60343:

    # ar "I thought I told you to call me Arty?"
    ar "我不是告诉过你叫我阿蒂吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_81d062d0:

    # a "I remember! I was just being polite because I brought a guest who wanted to come along on the patrols."
    a "我记得！只是因为我带了一位想一起巡查的客人，所以才这么礼貌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_b066dd1c:

    # "Arty waves Amble off the moment he mentions you again."
    "阿蒂·波波安布一提到你 就立刻离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_5d388e67:

    # ar "I understand, but there's no need to be formal."
    ar "我明白，但没必要这么正式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_14cd1046:

    # ar "He's definitely gone above and beyond formality around these parts."
    ar "在这附近，他绝对把“正式”发挥到了极致。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_6c223db8:

    # "You turn scarlet when you look at the ravenous hunger in Arty's eyes."
    "你看向阿蒂眼中贪婪的欲望时，脸一下子红透了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_0776ad1b:

    # e "I apologize for being inappropriate, Mr. Arthur."
    e "抱歉，是我失礼了，亚瑟先生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_763bbdf9:

    # ar "Please, call me Arty for now. And don't be ridiculous, if anything, I'd prefer you be more inappropriate."
    ar "请暂时叫我阿蒂吧。别这么说，如果可以的话，我反而希望你更放肆一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_a4e824fd:

    # ar "If you like the sound of that, you're always welcome to come by for a fun time..."
    ar "如果你喜欢这样，随时欢迎来我家找乐子……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_51f6b85a:

    # "The old man says this with a wink and waggle of the eyebrows. However playful, you're decently confident he's serious, if his slowly growing bulge was anything to go by."
    "老人说着眨了眨眼，还挑了挑眉。尽管语气很顽皮，但你相当确定他是认真的——他逐渐鼓起的下体就是证据。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_3c08b624:

    # e "Yes, umm. We'll see! For now I'm on patrol with Amble."
    e "是的,我们拭目以待,我现在和安布一起巡逻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_f2dd3899:

    # ar "Are you saying Amble is going to be keeping you busy instead?"
    ar "你是说安布会让你忙得不可开交吗?"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_81aa4915:

    # e "No! No! Nothing like that."
    e "不！不！不是那种事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_99e70186:

    # "Arty lets out a disappointed sigh."
    "阿蒂失望地叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_1e8b3819:

    # ar "Aww, and here I thought the two of you had been up to some fun."
    ar "哎呀，我还以为你们两个已经一起找过乐子了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_942aec22:

    # ar "What do you say, Amble? Would you take him up on some fun if he offered?"
    ar "你觉得呢,安布?"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_9e606d75:

    # "The question hits Amble out of nowhere, but the bear seems completely unsurprised as he gives a frustratingly honest answer."
    "这个问题无缘无故地打中安布,但熊似乎完全不感到惊讶,因为他给出了一个令人沮丧的诚实答案。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_c865c10e:

    # a "Yes! In fact, we already have before!"
    a "是啊！事实上，我们以前已经做过了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_4f8a783e:

    # "If it were possible to turn more red, you would have. Unfortunately, you have no avenue by which to express your embarrassment properly."
    "如果还能再红一点，你肯定会红得更厉害。可惜你实在找不到合适的方式表达自己的窘迫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_5702c2db:

    # ar "And? As good as I suspect?"
    ar "怎么样？和我想的一样棒吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_32ebe75e:

    # "Amble shrugs at Arty, a slight smile playing at his lips."
    "安布朝阿蒂耸了耸肩，嘴角挂着一丝笑意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_6cc6afa1:

    # a "Better, I think."
    a "我觉得更棒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_06a58fc0:

    # ar "Ooh, perfect. Well, the offer is definitely still there if you want to!"
    ar "哦，太好了。你想来的话，这个邀请一直有效！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_2ed87076:

    # "All you can do is nod."
    "你只能点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_c2d58ba8:

    # ar "I'm just a farmer. If anything, I should be speaking respectively of the two of you."
    ar "我只是个农民。真要说起来，应该是我恭敬地称呼你们两个才对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_02d61672:

    # ar "Oh, but I'm getting ahead of myself. What's your name, pup?"
    ar "不过我扯远了。小家伙，你叫什么名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_340a4782:

    # "This is the first time you've been called that that you can recall -- the proper term would be hatchling, but the meaning is understood."
    "这是你记得的第一次有人这么叫你——严格来说应该是“幼龙”，但意思你明白。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_b8798de8:

    # ar "Hello?"
    ar "喂？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_22483c57:

    # "It seems you had frozen for a few seconds to process what he said."
    "看来你花了几秒钟才回过神来，理解他说的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_718644ff:

    # e "Ah, sorry. I'm [e]."
    e "啊，抱歉。我叫[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_ec1fe05a:

    # "Arty gives you what seems to be a genuine smile."
    "阿蒂朝你露出一个看起来发自真心的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_91baf5f6:

    # ar "An excellent name, if not particularly common around these parts."
    ar "真是个好名字，只是这一带不太常见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_fd5ed9a8:

    # e "I... like your name too, Arty."
    e "我……我也喜欢你的名字，阿蒂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_acaa5dc8:

    # "The Shepherd looks at you skeptically, but decides to drop the topic."
    "牧羊人狐疑地看了你一眼，但决定不再纠结这个话题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_9d58ab4f:

    # ar "Well, I'm glad you're here, Amble."
    ar "很高兴你来了 安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_ebc7d6dd:

    # ar "The scarecrow is already at the start of its learning period, and if we delay too much longer, it may become a dud."
    ar "稻草人已经开始学习了，要是再拖下去太久，它可能会变成废品。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_694874f5:

    # a "Bring him out here then! My puny friend here and I will teach him how to scare away crows and landsharks!"
    a "把它带出来吧！我和我的小不点朋友会教它怎么吓走乌鸦和陆鲨！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_c56c0120:

    # "Arthur walks into his farm at a brisk pace, it is only moments afterwards that the man reappears with a slightly twitching scarecrow."
    "亚瑟快步走进农场，没过多久就带着一只微微抽搐的稻草人出来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_bf4e34bd:

    # ar "I'll leave him out here with you for now. I'll be taking my morning nap inside if you need me."
    ar "我暂时把它留在这里给你们。如果需要我，我会回屋里补个早觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_bd43a8e5:

    # "Amble gives him a nod and begins lugging the scarecrow out towards the clearing."
    "安布朝他点了点头，开始费力地把稻草人拖向空地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_f3c937d9:

    # e "So, do we do anything special to teach the scarecrow?"
    e "所以，我们要做什么特别的事来教稻草人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_379b7e9c:

    # a "No, puny friend. He is learning the whole time! Even now he learns out to drag people away by their arms."
    a "不用，小不点。它一直都在学习！就连现在，它也在学习如何拽住别人的胳膊把人拖走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_87609acd:

    # "You give Amble a concerned look."
    "你给安布一个关心的眼神。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_0c3b4584:

    # e "Should we be teaching him that?"
    e "我们应该教它这个吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_35a9056f:

    # "The carefree bear gives you a shrug."
    "悠闲的熊朝你耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_93ee391e:

    # a "Why not. Nobody but the farmers go around here, and the scarecrows know the score. If they attack me, well. That's just a patrol made more interesting."
    a "为什么不呢？这里除了农民没人会来，而且稻草人知道规矩。要是它们攻击我，嗯，那也只是让巡查变得更有趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_f732e3ce:

    # "A worrying thought process to say the least."
    "这思路至少可以说是令人担忧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_88580fbe:

    # e "Well, I guess we'll see how it goes."
    e "好吧，那就看看会怎样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_4e9363ea:

    # "Amble gives you a wide smile."
    "安布给你一个宽广的微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_17dc296b:

    # a "Exactly! Take life as it comes."
    a "没错！顺其自然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_84eb2c77:

    # "The bear shifts his grip on the scarecrow, and pushes it into the farmland soil."
    "熊调整了一下抓稻草人的姿势，把它插进农田的土里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_f2585994:

    # a "For example! What do you think I should teach the scarecrow first?"
    a "比如说！你觉得我该先教稻草人什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_8dfb5e66:

    # e "I don't know... how to be scary?"
    e "我不知道……怎么吓人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_035e960e:

    # a "That's easy. Here!"
    a "这简单。看好了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_42662357:

    # "Amble tilts his head back, teeth bared. A low growl begins to come from his throat."
    "安布仰起头，露出牙齿。低沉的咆哮开始从喉咙里传出。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_c96f31e4:

    # "It quickly builds into a full roar, one that fills the air and leaves echoes for minutes."
    "那声音很快升级成震耳欲聋的咆哮，响彻空气，回声持续了好几分钟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_b5001483:

    # "The bear looks over at you, slightly hurt. You only realize why when you see that you had backed away from him in fear."
    "熊转头看向你，似乎有些受伤。直到发现自己害怕地退离了他，你才明白原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_cdb4673c:

    # e "Sorry, hehe -- It just worked so well! That's the first time I've seen you look anything but happy and sweet."
    e "抱歉，嘿嘿——只是效果太好了！这是我第一次见你露出除了开心和乖巧以外的表情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_144330b8:

    # a "I know. I have to work hard to maintain the image of a friendly bear. We don't exactly look harmless."
    a "我知道。要维持友善熊的形象可得下不少功夫。我们看起来可不算无害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_ad115aaa:

    # "In fairness, you can see what he means. Never before now had you realized how sharp his teeth were, the size of his claws -- the fact that he stood over a foot over you."
    "公平地说，你现在明白他的意思了。之前你从未意识到他的牙齿有多锋利、爪子有多大——更没注意到他比你高出一尺多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_3425e4e4:

    # "It would be best to change the subject."
    "最好换个话题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_4ce50a6f:

    # e "Well, I think the scarecrow should have learned by now. How can we check?"
    e "我觉得稻草人现在应该学会了。我们怎么确认？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_51025aa8:

    # "To that, Amble just gives you a smile. He takes a little drawing of a crow eating wheat out, and shows it to the scarecrow."
    "安布给你一个微笑,他画了一只乌鸦吃小麦, 把它展示给稻草人看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_0b534566:

    # "Immediately, it begins to shake. It starts with the gentle dragging of branch against branch, the sounds of a suffering tree."
    "它立刻开始颤抖。起初是树枝相互摩擦的轻响，仿佛是受苦的树发出的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_03c47d6d:

    # "The sound it ends with is... what you would imagine a tree screaming would sound like."
    "最后的声音是……你想象中一棵树尖叫起来会发出的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_e37a38f4:

    # e "Alarmingly efficient."
    e "效率高得吓人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_8e4fa289:

    # "The bear turns to you with a cheeky grin."
    "熊转过身，朝你露出坏笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_7c7f985b:

    # a "Right? Now, give me a second, this next one will take a while."
    a "对吧？现在给我一点时间，接下来这个要花一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_6c7a0c8e:

    # e "...what are you teaching it now?"
    e "……你现在要教它什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_6d3a2b6d:

    # e "Isn't scaring all it has to do?"
    e "它不是只要会吓人就够了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_0eddac3b:

    # "Uproarious laughter is your immediate response."
    "你立刻爆发出一阵哄堂大笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_7c66bb51:

    # a "Maybe for most! But I'm raising a fighter if I have anything to do with it."
    a "大多数情况下是！但只要有我在，我就要把它培养成一名战士。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_b36f01b8:

    # "Amble begins punching the air and hopping back and forth, as if he had only one leg to move on."
    "安布开始对着空气出拳，来回蹦跳，仿佛只有一条腿能动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_5f5d48de:

    # e "W-what are you doing?"
    e "你、你在干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_d6e130ab:

    # "He looks like an insane person. A dangerous, two-hundred pound insane person."
    "他看起来像个疯子——一个危险的、足有两百磅重的疯子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_1e371d43:

    # a "I'm teaching him boxing! They don't carry weapons, so I've practiced seeing if I could beat a landshark like this!"
    a "我在教它拳击！它们不带武器，所以我一直在练习看看能不能用这招打败陆鲨！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_37589c8a:

    # "It's nice to be Amble's friend, and not having to worry about dying at his hands. If the man can stop a landshark like this..."
    "很高兴能成为安布的朋友 不必担心死在他手上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_89e4d00e:

    # "He could probably snap your spine like a twig."
    "他大概能像折断树枝一样折断你的脊椎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_ff77b352:

    # e "So, umm. It's okay to talk while you teach it this?"
    e "呃……你教它的时候，我们可以聊天吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_bc437b94:

    # a "Yeah! It's going to be a while, so talking would be the most fun!"
    a "当然！这得花一会儿，聊天才最有趣！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_8153ba6b:

    # "You have permission to talk from Amble, but... what can you even talk about?"
    "你有安布允许你说话 但是... 你能说什么呢?"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_75c619c9:

    # "The best start you can think of is your commonalities as adventurers."
    "你能想到的最好开场白，就是谈谈你们作为冒险者的共同点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_445b6beb:

    # e "Hey, Amble! I've never really asked why you do this? Adventure, I mean."
    e "嘿,安布,我从没问过你为什么要这么做?"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_ed7cbdb1:

    # a "Well! Being an adventurer is all about helping people."
    a "嗯！当冒险者就是要帮助别人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_5e8bf3f5:

    # a "Helping people is fun! Even if helping sometimes means diving into a pit full of angry chickens to collect an eg."
    a "帮助别人很有趣！就算有时所谓的帮助，是跳进满是愤怒的鸡的坑里捡鸡蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_9ffec77a:

    # a "People smile when I help them. I wouldn't trade that for anything else in the world!"
    a "我帮助别人时，他们会对我微笑。我愿意用世上的任何东西来交换这份回报！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_d8c22196:

    # "Anyone else would have felt like they were opening up their soul, but Amble seems completely nonchalant, focused mainly on teaching the scarecrow boxing."
    "其他人都会觉得他们正在敞开心扉 但安布似乎完全没有动静 重点是教稻草人拳击。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_a2a89a64:

    # e "Alright, well... what if you get a job you don't want? Like the person is bad or something?"
    e "好吧，那么……如果你接到一份不想做的工作呢？比如对方是个坏人之类的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_781566c0:

    # "The bear momentarily slows in his boxing, before you realizing and picking the pace back up."
    "熊的出拳暂时慢了下来，你察觉到后，他又恢复了速度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_d6a0e712:

    # a "I won't help them! If them smiling means most others don't, why would I help them?"
    a "我不会帮他们！如果他们的笑容意味着大多数人都笑不出来，我为什么要帮他们？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_29638e93:

    # a "Plus, I don't think anybody is inherently good or bad! Just better in the moment or not."
    a "而且，我不觉得有人天生就是好人或坏人！只分当下做得好不好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_c2ae6fb1:

    # e "What about the people that decieve you. Aren't they bad people? What do you do when that happens?"
    e "那欺骗你的人呢？他们难道不是坏人？遇到这种事你会怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_949b82ba:

    # "Amble smiles as he boxes -- the question is quite fun to him for some reason."
    "安布一边出拳一边微笑，不知为何，这个问题似乎让他觉得很有趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_8061ff9a:

    # a "Depends what they made me do, or how they deceived me."
    a "要看他们让我做了什么，或者他们是怎么骗我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_6e529922:

    # a "Normally? I give them a pat on the back and tell them don't do it again, or chuckle that they got one over me."
    a "通常？我会拍拍他们的背，告诉他们别再这么做；或者笑着承认他们骗过了我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_5db0a695:

    # a "Sometimes I have to do much more. It brings me no pleasure to kill or imprison, but sometimes that is the only solution I see."
    a "有时我不得不做得更多。杀人或监禁并不能让我开心，但有时那是我能想到的唯一办法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_b5858c47:

    # "Again, the perfect clarity with which he says that scares you."
    "他把这话说得异常清楚，再一次让你感到害怕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_e9daa2bd:

    # "You have a feeling he would just as easily kill a man as a squirrel -- it all depended on the circumstances to him."
    "你感觉对他来说，杀一个人和杀一只松鼠一样容易——一切都取决于具体情况。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_6b7eff08:

    # "Your brain whirls with questions, but you can't bring yourself to ask them after that last one."
    "你脑子里有一大堆问题在打转，但听了刚才那句，你怎么也问不出口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_1bae045b:

    # "It's Amble who breaks the silence with a question of his own."
    "安布用自己的问题打破了沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_95bbfd27:

    # a "Why do you do it?"
    a "你为什么要这么做？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_a02f1f15:

    # "You look up in shock."
    "你震惊地抬起头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_5a89ac8b:

    # e "Because I enjoy it. I enjoy adventure, helping... but I enjoy meeting people most of all."
    e "因为我喜欢。我喜欢冒险，喜欢帮助别人……但我最喜欢的还是认识新的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_b6a04182:

    # e "At least, I think that's why I enjoy it. It's hard to know stuff like that."
    e "至少我觉得这是原因。像这种事很难说清楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_fcb05fb3:

    # "Amble nods as he moves, but realizes that might give the scarecrow the wrong idea."
    "安布一边移动一边点头，却意识到这样可能会给稻草人错误的暗示。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_acdba4f3:

    # a "I get that."
    a "我明白。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_60a0abc8:

    # a "Do you ever doubt yourself, though? I know I do, when I fail to help, or struggle to understand what's happening around me."
    a "不过，你有没有怀疑过自己？我在帮不上忙，或者难以理解周围发生的事时，就会怀疑自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_eb9c5718:

    # e "You mean in general?"
    e "你是说一般意义上的怀疑？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_035e74da:

    # "Amble laughs softly."
    "安布轻笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_0c6eb1b3:

    # a "No. Everyone doubts themselves. I'm asking if you ever doubt your ability to be an adventurer -- if it would be better for someone else to."
    a "不。每个人都会怀疑自己。我是在问，你有没有怀疑过自己是否有能力成为冒险者——或者让别人来做是不是更好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_0200fb1e:

    # "There's a question you had never thought about. When you think about it, you're probably a pretty bad adventurer in most ways."
    "这是你从未想过的问题。仔细想想，你在大多数方面都算不上一个好冒险者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_36eee853:

    # "But the people around you seem to appreciate you for what you do. So maybe there's no reason to worry?"
    "但身边的人似乎认可你所做的一切。所以，也许没什么好担心的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_84be01e8:

    # e "Yeah, but never enough to really matter."
    e "是啊，但还远远不够，根本算不上什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_0e4c7c36:

    # e "You?"
    e "你呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_89b7afae:

    # "Amble's face forms a self-deprecating smile, even as he continues his boxing flawlessly."
    "安布脸上浮现出自嘲的笑容，出拳的动作却依然完美无瑕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_8e4268eb:

    # a "Always."
    a "总是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_2a0d634c:

    # e "And what do you do then?"
    e "那你会怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_f317f056:

    # a "What I always do when I struggle --"
    a "我遇到困难时一向如此——"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_2bac1769:

    # a "Believe I'm the good person I know I am, and find a way forward."
    a "相信自己本来就是个好人，然后想办法继续前进。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_c7e71f68:

    # a "Most of my problems tend to disappear if I punch them hard enough. The ones that don't, I find someone to fix."
    a "大多数问题，只要我用力揍上几拳，往往就会消失。那些揍不好的，我就找人来解决。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_3fd82587:

    # "You open your mouth to ask a question, but realize the bear hasn't stopped speaking."
    "你张嘴想问，但发现熊还没有停下说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_fefec6d1:

    # a "And before you ask what I do if that doesn't work. I try anyways."
    a "而且，别急着问如果这样也没用我会怎么办。我还是会试试。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_ca0e65ef:

    # a "Giving up gets you nowhere. So fight, rage if you have to. Pull a way up to the surfa-"
    a "放弃解决不了任何问题。所以战斗吧，必要时就发怒。想办法爬到水面——"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_5e464ca2:

    # "The bear suddenly stops moving."
    "熊突然停下了动作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_2f9d376a:

    # a "I finished that sooner than I thought!"
    a "我比想象中更快完成了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_ec659829:

    # a "These next few require some more concentration, as they involve actually feeling out landsharks -- something hard for even me to teach."
    a "接下来几个动作需要更集中注意力，因为要真正感受陆鲨——就连我也很难教别人这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_5019e043:

    # a "We can finish talking some other time, puny friend."
    a "小不点，我们改天再聊完吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_8653c8f4:

    # e "O-okay."
    e "好、好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_758874ca:

    # "Yet again, the jolly giant shows you an intensity you'd never thought was there. Should you be afraid of that? Or respect him all the more?"
    "这位快乐的巨人又一次展现出你从未想过他拥有的强烈一面。你该害怕吗？还是应该更加敬重他？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_80e485d2:

    # "It's hard to tell. The same person that told you to fight until death itself takes you is currently pressing against the floor with one finger and wiggling it around in front of a scarecrow."
    "很难说。那个告诉你要战斗到死的人，此刻正用一根手指压着地面，在稻草人面前扭来扭去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_548663ca:

    # "There's something off about him. You know that now, and you want to know more."
    "他有些不对劲。现在你知道了，也想了解更多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_6bd9e1bd:

    # "For now, however, you'll have to content yourself with knowing he cares about you, and has a theoretically positive goal."
    "不过现在，你只能先满足于知道他在乎你，而且至少有一个理论上积极的目标。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_1f9a1fec:

    # "I mean, what's the worst you can do when your goal in life is to make people smile."
    "毕竟，一个人生目标是让人微笑的人，最坏又能坏到哪里去？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_b617aa58:

    # "Amble finishes teaching the scarecrow after a few hours."
    "几个小时后，安布终于教完了稻草人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_99778fde:

    # "It's mostly uneventful, except for a few moments here and there where he used you as a training dummy example for his student."
    "除此之外没发生什么大事，只有几次他把你当作示范用的训练人偶，教给他的学生看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_9b5e1530:

    # "As soon as he's satisfied that the scarecrow is ready, Amble runs up to the Farmer's door and leaves it on the porch."
    "只要他确定稻草人准备好了 安布就跑到农夫的门前 把它留在门廊上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_07adc02e:

    # "It seems Arty woke up and came out for a bit, as you see a small wooden plate with corn on it."
    "看起来阿蒂醒来后出来了一会儿，因为你看到一只小木盘，上面放着玉米。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_e04650c8:

    # "There are two notes that go along with it."
    "旁边还有两张纸条。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_2e209e32:

    # "One reads: 'To the two lovely gentlemen helping me with my farm, I leave this corn. It's not much, but I can promise that it's good stuff, raised with love and care.'"
    "其中一张写着：‘给两位帮我照看农场的可爱先生，这是我送的玉米。虽然不多，但我保证它们是用心照料、精心种出来的好东西。’"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_08dd9408:

    # "The next, which is clearly for you considering the little winking face Arty has drawn on it reads: 'If you ever want to take me up on that offer, here are the directions to my house. You'll have fun if I'm right about you.'"
    "下一张纸条上画着阿蒂画的小笑脸，显然是给你的：‘如果你什么时候想接受我的邀请，这里是我家的地址。如果我没猜错你的话，你一定会玩得很开心。’"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_4bdd7fde:

    # "Blushing, you take a piece of corn off of the table, and stuff the note into your bag. You might need it later."
    "你红着脸从桌上拿起一根玉米，把纸条塞进包里。以后也许用得上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_d565e233:

    # "There is a note that goes along with it."
    "还有一张纸条附在旁边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_03b9e3df:

    # "Amble leads you further on your patrol, the two of you eating Arty's corn with little small talk thrown in."
    "安布带你继续巡查，你们一边吃着阿蒂的玉米，一边随意聊着几句。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_fffb4829:

    # "It really is good corn."
    "这玉米确实很好吃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_02a75b90:

    # "The rest of Amble's patrol is fairly uneventful -- farmers come out of their houses to say hello to Amble, and give him little gifts as thanks for his generosity."
    "安布的其余巡逻队相当平庸-- 农民们走出家门 向安布问好, 给他一点礼物,以示感谢他的慷慨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_f3361510:

    # "'Thank you for getting rid of that rast infestation! Thank you for carrying my son to Lusterfield to get treated!' All the while giving the bear corn, peaches, even a keg of beer."
    "感谢你们把我儿子带到乐斯民菲尔德接受治疗!"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_3b75ca66:

    # "Amble took them all -- except the keg of beer, which he told the man to sell to Cane if anything -- with a smile on his face, and pride in his eyes."
    "安布把他们全带走 除了啤酒桶之外 他告诉那个男人要卖给凯恩 如果有什么东西的话 他脸上有笑容 眼里有自豪感。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_7d5437ca:

    # "Seeing him like this, you think you can understand a little better what Amble does and why."
    "看到他这样子,你就会觉得你更了解 安布做什么和为什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_d9f870cb:

    # "Even if he still makes no sense sometimes."
    "尽管他有时还是让人摸不着头脑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_3d91a2a7:

    # "Eventually, you find yourself back in Lusterfield, seven hours of patrol having flown by."
    "最后,你发现自己回到了乐斯民菲尔德 巡逻了7个小时。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_b677057a:

    # a "So, did you have fun?"
    a "所以，你玩得开心吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_2ae6d1ca:

    # "You take a moment to think about the day."
    "你花了片刻回想这一天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_4ac26754:

    # "There wasn't all that much to do, but it was nice to see the houses and people. It was nice to help."
    "虽然没做太多事，但看看房屋和人们也挺不错。能帮上忙也很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_e1e7cf90:

    # e "I don't know if I had fun, but I enjoyed it."
    e "我不知道算不算开心，但我确实很享受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_19f6b646:

    # "Amble grins at you, happy to finally have someone that enjoyed a patrol with him."
    "安布朝你咧嘴一笑，终于有人喜欢和他一起巡查，他显得很高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_46617245:

    # "The bear runs up to you and fittingly pulls you up in a bear hug."
    "熊跑到你身边，顺势把你拉进一个熊抱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_8977bcf3:

    # a "That's wonderful news, Puny Friend!"
    a "这真是个好消息，小不点！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_81f41d02:

    # a "Would you be willing to go on patrol again someday?"
    a "你以后还愿意再来巡查吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_bc3d0837:

    # "It's your turn to grin at Amble -- it seems he enjoyed your company after all."
    "轮到你对安布笑了 看来他还是喜欢你的陪伴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_87d41023:

    # e "I think I would!"
    e "我想我愿意！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_048feb75:

    # e "But for now, I should go get my things in order. It's been a long day."
    e "不过现在，我该去整理一下东西了。今天真是漫长的一天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_577a31b2:

    # "Amble nods sagely."
    "安布老成地点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_f3c97dca:

    # a "It has."
    a "确实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_64c39215:

    # a "Make sure to enjoy yourself out there!"
    a "出去后记得好好享受！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_92ce049c:

    # "It's hard not to smile with the big lug around."
    "有这个大块头在身边，实在很难不笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_030f98e7:

    # e "I'll try. You do the same, alright?"
    e "我会的。你也一样，好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Patrol_Farm_03ecf6e3:

    # a "Always, puny friend, always."
    a "永远如此，小不点，永远如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_21885734:

    # a "Puny Friend, I have a small favor to ask of you."
    a "小不点，我想请你帮个小忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_571d09a5:

    # "Amble is looking at you with eyes filled to the brim with sweetness and innocence."
    "安布看着你，眼里满是甜蜜和天真。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_a84b8e8f:

    # "It's pretty intense, actually."
    "其实，这事还挺严重的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_8b0f1a4d:

    # e "S-Sure, what do you need, Amble?"
    e "S-S-当然,你需要什么,安布?"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_fc3a40b6:

    # a "Wonderful!"
    a "太棒了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_80ea9533:

    # "He wraps you up in a tight hug and whirls you around"
    "他紧紧抱住你，带着你转起圈来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_4e9cb60b:

    # "It's a great feeling, except that all the air in your lungs has been forcefully pushed out"
    "感觉很棒，只是你肺里的空气全被强行挤了出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_5ba17e85:

    # e "...Amble... please... I can't breathe."
    e "……安布……求你了……我喘不过气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_94357036:

    # a "Oh! Sorry, Puny Friend, I was very happy to hear that you could help."
    a "哦！抱歉，小不点，听说你愿意帮忙我太高兴了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_1072b38d:

    # "He gently puts you back down."
    "他轻轻把你放回地面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_01280011:

    # a "It's very important that this gets done as soon as possible, and I've been too busy with Lot to do it."
    a "这件事必须尽快完成，而我一直忙着和洛哥处理事情，没时间做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_b5382edf:

    # e "Is it okay if I take a couple days to do it?"
    e "我花几天时间做完可以吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_658a2ef3:

    # "Amble gives you a sidelong look"
    "安布给大家一个侧面的外观"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_a3378ef6:

    # a "It would be best if you didn't, but yes, in theory everything would be fine."
    a "最好不要，但理论上应该没问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_bf8f84fb:

    # "Amble coughs into his hand before straightening his back and puts his hand behind his back in imitation of a military officer."
    "安布先对着手咳嗽一声，然后挺直腰，把手背到身后，模仿军官的姿势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_82c5f9fa:

    # a "The farmlands of Lusterfield are regularly plagued by landsharks."
    a "乐斯民菲尔德的农地经常被山地猎人所困扰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_02a05f62:

    # a "Every so often, someone must go through and cull their numbers or otherwise render them harmless."
    a "隔一段时间，就得有人去清理它们的数量，或者用其他方式让它们失去威胁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_3d8e499c:

    # e "Do the landsharks attack people often or something?"
    e "陆鲨经常攻击人之类的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_2418ba39:

    # "Amble stops a moment to consider his next words. Turns out this issue may be more complex than you thought."
    "安布停下来思考接下来该说什么。事实证明，这个问题可能比你想象的复杂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_3ad05164:

    # a "No, not exactly, though they sometimes do."
    a "不，不能完全这么说，虽然它们有时确实会攻击人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_c7e528c5:

    # a "They're territorial creatures, and attack whatever walks into what they consider theirs."
    a "它们是有领地意识的生物，会攻击任何闯入它们认定属于自己的地盘的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_bbfeb8db:

    # e "So why are they such a big problem?"
    e "那它们为什么会造成这么大的问题？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_5a8f07c7:

    # a "Well, they do hunt outside of their territory, and in doing so, tear up the fields the farmers work so hard to tend to."
    a "嗯，它们确实会跑到领地外捕猎，也因此会毁掉农民辛苦耕作的田地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_fa0c7b3d:

    # a "That's why it's your job to patrol the area and kick out any landsharks that aren't where they're supposed to be"
    a "所以，你的工作就是巡查这一带，把不该出现在这里的陆鲨赶走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_4a55765d:

    # "Amble grins a bit, getting out of his military impression to his more casual and cuddly self."
    "安布微微一笑，收起军官腔，恢复了平时随和亲人的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_f558aa5a:

    # a "I normally go there and do some guard duty in my free time..."
    a "我平时有空就会去那边做些守卫工作……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_2834983e:

    # "Amble leans down to your ear, lowering his in a conspiratorial whisper, which for him is about as loud as a normal person's speech."
    "安布俯身靠到你耳边，压低声音神秘兮兮地耳语——对他来说，这音量几乎和普通人说话一样大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_7132bb9e:

    # a "But now I gotta stay around here and take care of those two. Y'know, make sure they're hale and hearty."
    a "但现在我得留在这里照顾那两个家伙。你懂的，确保他们身体健康、精神饱满。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_e0e4a66d:

    # a "Anyways!"
    a "总之！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_79e7d3c2:

    # "Amble yells that as he leans away from you, eliciting a pained yelp from the nearby Jog, clearly listening in on the conversation."
    "安布一边远离你一边大声喊道，附近偷听这段对话的乔格痛苦地叫了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_f646e09a:

    # a "Get out there and hunt some landsharks [e]!"
    a "出去猎杀些陆鲨吧，[e]！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_a4c4caaf:

    # e "You called me by my name!"
    e "你刚才叫我的名字！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_926d310b:

    # a "Dunno what you're talking about, Puny Friend."
    a "不知道你在说什么，小不点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_4a99c05c:

    # a "Regardless, thanks for going out and doing this for me."
    a "不管怎样，谢谢你愿意出去帮我处理这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_f12e1d39:

    # e "Yeah, you got it."
    e "好，交给我吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_1b1d1073:

    # e "But, umm... How many sharks am I supposed to deal with for you?"
    e "不过，呃……你要我帮你处理多少只陆鲨？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_dc7986bd:

    # a "Oh. Right."
    a "哦，对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_7e32cbe7:

    # a "How about a quarter of a half what I usually do, meaning around 3!"
    a "就按我平时数量的八分之一吧，也就是大约三只！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_80357197:

    # "You take a moment to think about the fact that Amble is implying that he regularly goes out and beats up 24 sharks."
    "你花点时间想想 安布暗示他经常出去 打24只鲨鱼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_ab994785:

    # "You're suddenly very grateful he's an ally, and not an enemy."
    "你突然非常庆幸他是盟友而不是敌人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_301cccce:

    # e "S-sounds good to me!"
    e "听、听起来不错！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_ff7d9dac:

    # e "How will you know that I've actually defeated them?"
    e "你怎么知道我真的打败了它们？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_34a64cf9:

    # a "Well, I trust you, but... I'll know. Comes with knowing one of the best information sources in town."
    a "嗯，我相信你，不过……我会知道的。认识镇上最可靠的情报来源之一，自然有这种好处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_8a05b5b9:

    # e "Fair enough. I'll be back after dealing with the land sharks!"
    e "没问题。处理完这些陆鲨我就回来！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_bc1165af:

    # a "Puny Friend!"
    a "小不点！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_a518af79:

    # e "...yes?"
    e "……怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_320b2166:

    # a "The landsharks are becoming a problem again."
    a "陆鲨又开始成为问题了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_e9c5ec9e:

    # e "I take it you want me to clear them again?"
    e "我是不是该再去清理它们？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_02643c5e:

    # a "It would be helpful, puny friend."
    a "那会很有帮助，小不点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Ask_Patrol_Task_40976935:

    # e "Alright, I'll take it."
    e "好吧，我接下了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_fba2453e:

    # e "I finished with the landsharks!"
    e "我把陆鲨处理完了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_7ad89eb8:

    # "You see Amble look at you skeptically."
    "你看安布 看着你怀疑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_a0153810:

    # a "I know you haven't beaten 3 yet. A little bird has been keeping me updated on your progress."
    a "我知道你还没打败三只。一直有只小鸟在告诉我你的进度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_c77aa16b:

    # a "You can do this, I believe in you, Puny Friend. Come back when you've finished."
    a "你可以的，我相信你，小不点。完成后再回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_be06a96f:

    # "A mischievous twinkle is visible in the corner of Amble's eye."
    "安布的眼角 可以看到一股凶恶的闪光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_c2f510b5:

    # a "Puny Friend, I know I'm not great at math, but I know that you haven't beaten 3 sharks."
    a "小不点，我数学虽然不好，但我知道你还没打败三只陆鲨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_c784ed3a:

    # a "Come report back to me when you've done so!"
    a "完成后回来向我报告！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_0b672209:

    # a "Ah! Puny Friend! I see you finished dealing with the landsharks!"
    a "啊！小不点！我看得出来你已经处理完陆鲨了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_1590dbe9:

    # e "How did you know?"
    e "你怎么知道的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_13e9fc02:

    # a "Someone kept me updated on your progress the entire time."
    a "一直有人在向我汇报你的进度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_a7013467:

    # "You... aren't going to think about the implications of that."
    "你……还是别去想这意味着什么了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_fff2b4ae:

    # a "You also have the look of someone who just fought 3 sharks."
    a "你看起来也像刚和三只陆鲨打过一架。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_334c3d38:

    # e "What kind of look is that?"
    e "这是什么样子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_8baa9034:

    # "Amble breaks out into a wide grin, slapping you on the back."
    "安布咧嘴一笑，拍了拍你的后背。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_9938a5f5:

    # a "Tired, Puny Friend. Tired, but satisfied."
    a "累了，小不点。很累，但很满足。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_a0df4116:

    # "Amble stops talking for a moment, a worryingly naughty smile playing across his lips."
    "安布暂时停下话头，唇边浮起一个令人不安的淘气笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_dbc79649:

    # a "Lot also stopped by to see if we knew where you were."
    a "洛哥也来过，问我们知不知道你在哪里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_3ebafa45:

    # e "What did you tell him...?"
    e "你告诉他什么了……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_c4d7c3d4:

    # "Amble scratches the side of his head for a moment, as if trying to recall what happened."
    "安布挠了挠头，像是在努力回忆发生了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_ffc29af7:

    # "It would be convincing if he didn't look like he was trying to hold in a full-throated laugh."
    "要不是他看起来正拼命忍住放声大笑的冲动，这话倒还挺有说服力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_34e0e7f5:

    # a "Ah, I just told him I had sent you off on a dangerous mission."
    a "啊，我就告诉他，我派你去执行一项危险任务了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_f0066fa8:

    # a "He looked just about ready to kill me, saying we were going to go out and help you right that instant."
    a "他看起来差点就要杀了我，说我们要立刻出发去帮你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_dde7dcc3:

    # e "... That doesn't really sound like Lothar."
    e "听起来不像洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_6ff7753c:

    # a "You'd be surprised at some of the things the Hero of Lusterfield really thinks deep down."
    a "你会对乐斯民菲尔德的英雄 内心深处的想法感到惊讶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_1e9e8466:

    # "A playful twinkle shines in the corner of Amble's eye."
    "安布眼角闪闪发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_6300879a:

    # a "But, if anyone asks, I said nothing."
    a "不过，如果有人问起，我什么都没说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_88f0a92c:

    # e "Amble... Jog is right there..."
    e "安布,乔格就在那里..."

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_bd7e5fed:

    # a "Eh, Jog already knows. Plus, Lothar can be pretty obvious when you start to look closer."
    a "乔格已经知道了 而且洛萨尔在你靠近点看的时候 也可以看得很清楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_ff59d46e:

    # a "He relaxed and went back to his usual spot when we told you Jog was making sure you were safe."
    a "我们告诉他乔格会确保你的安全后，他才放松下来，回到平时待的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_1f5f4eb7:

    # j "Not after yelling at me for not telling him that first."
    j "在他因为我没先告诉他这件事而冲我大喊之后，可不是这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_3a2a26c4:

    # a "Right, that. I wasn't really listening, so I forgot all about it."
    a "对，就那件事。我当时没怎么听，所以全忘了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_4665f189:

    # "Amble feigns at picking his ear."
    "安布装作在掏耳朵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_e0bb7efb:

    # a "Regardless, thank you for getting the sharks dealt with!"
    a "不管怎样，谢谢你帮忙处理那些陆鲨！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_692037b9:

    # a "I don't really have any grand reward for you."
    a "我其实没有什么丰厚的奖励给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_c6b5ba0e:

    # a "But sometimes that's just how it is for an adventurer."
    a "但冒险者有时就是这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_30f0ec79:

    # "Out of anyone else, especially Cane, you'd think this was them trying to get out of paying you, but..."
    "其他人,特别是凯恩, 你会认为这是他们 试图摆脱支付你,但是..."

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_25de6e38:

    # "Amble seems to genuinely mean it."
    "安布看起来是真心这么想的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_cf9e64d5:

    # "You did help a lot of people today by dealing with the landsharks."
    "你今天处理陆鲨，确实帮助了很多人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_b00144c3:

    # "You feel a bit more like a hero."
    "你感觉自己更像个英雄了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_85e96f71:

    # "Amble has a bigger, goofier smile than normal on his face right now."
    "安布脸上的笑容 比现在的正常还要大 更傻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_a8f345e8:

    # a "You did it again Puny Friend!"
    a "你又做到了，小不点！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_16c0a1f1:

    # a "Thank you as always for being such a good friend!"
    a "一如既往地谢谢你做我的好朋友！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_62cd4714:

    # "Amble wraps you up in a big hug, this time making sure to let you breathe."
    "安布拥抱你, 这次让你呼吸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_bec446f6:

    # e "I-it's no problem Amble."
    e "我,这没什么问题,安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_b270a781:

    # "He puts you down, still smiling."
    "他依旧笑着把你放下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_9091b534:

    # a "Maybe, but I still appreciate it!"
    a "也许吧，但我还是很感激！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Report_Patrol_Task_09497927:

    # "There isn't really anything you can do but blush under the praise he's piling on."
    "面对他接连不断的夸赞，你除了脸红之外什么也做不了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_End_ebe727c3:

    # e "I think that's all for now."
    e "我想暂时就这些了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_End_5faed9f2:

    # e "Thank you so much, Amble."
    e "非常感谢你,安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Dialogue_End_849b2aab:

    # a "No need, and thank you for the time too."
    a "不用客气，也谢谢你愿意抽时间陪我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_About_Gnolls_cff65d3d:

    # e "Hey, Jog, what do you think about the gnolls?"
    e "嘿，乔格，你怎么看豺狼人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_About_Gnolls_c5e01851:

    # j "What... Gnolls? [e], are you asking about them because I look like one?"
    j "什么……豺狼人？[e]，你问这个，是因为我看起来像豺狼人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_About_Gnolls_90c3d4e3:

    # e "N-no! I just wanted to know what you thought about them. Since... you know, we live near them and all."
    e "不、不！我只是想知道你怎么看他们。毕竟……你知道，我们住得离他们很近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_About_Gnolls_1bd0da0a:

    # j "Oh. Well, I don't think about them much. They're just another creature in the wilds to me."
    j "哦。嗯，我不太会去想他们。对我来说，他们只不过是荒野里的另一种生物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_About_Gnolls_6f96978b:

    # j "They're not really my kind of people, let's put it that way."
    j "他们不太算是我喜欢的那类人，就这么说吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_About_Gnolls_becb3a19:

    # j "But... I do know they usually hunt together, led by a leader. While the rest of them spread out in the plains."
    j "不过……我知道他们通常会在首领带领下一起狩猎，其余成员则分散在平原上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_About_Gnolls_30874436:

    # e "Interesting, do you think they follow some sort of sounds sometimes?"
    e "有意思，你觉得他们有时会跟随某种声音吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_About_Gnolls_ab8f576d:

    # "Jog's eyes squints as he looks at you."
    "乔格看着你，眼睛微微眯了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_About_Gnolls_2d211da7:

    # j "Look, [e]. I know what happened to the flute, you could attract those gnolls with the sound of the flute, but it doesn't work anymore."
    j "听着，[e]。我知道那支笛子发生了什么，你可以用笛声吸引那些豺狼人，但现在已经不管用了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_About_Gnolls_5dfc7fe6:

    # j "Take it if you want, I lifted that thing myself anyway."
    j "你想要的话就拿去吧，反正那东西本来就是我自己偷来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Ask_About_Gnolls_8dc63a3b:

    # "Your sigh a breath of relief, at least he doesn't seem to know what you saw from the flute..."
    "你松了口气，至少他似乎不知道你从笛子上看到了什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_About_Gnolls_1727673b:

    # e "Hey, Lothar, what do you think about the gnolls?"
    e "嘿,洛萨尔,你觉得小鼻孔怎么样?"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_About_Gnolls_4455cee3:

    # l "Gnolls! Where?"
    l "豺狼人！在哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_About_Gnolls_ae3314d9:

    # "Lothar immediately stands up, looking around wildly."
    "洛萨尔立即站起来 狂野地四处看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_About_Gnolls_bdfdbfaa:

    # e "No, not here. Just in general."
    e "不，不是说这里。只是泛泛而谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_About_Gnolls_19bd7f21:

    # l "Phew... These evil creatures must all be vanquished, wipe them off the map! We cannot let them roam free on the plains!"
    l "呼……这些邪恶的生物必须全部消灭，把它们从地图上抹去！不能让它们在平原上自由游荡！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_About_Gnolls_423ba927:

    # e "Whoa, calm down Lothar. They're not that bad."
    e "冷静下来,洛萨尔,他们没那么坏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_About_Gnolls_75685291:

    # l "Not that bad? They are vile, disgusting creatures that poses dangers to everyone, Worse than the bandits!"
    l "没那么严重？它们是卑鄙、恶心、会给所有人带来危险的生物，比强盗还糟糕！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_About_Gnolls_a658f5c1:

    # e "I don't think they're worse than bandits... they just like to play around."
    e "我不觉得它们比强盗更糟……它们只是喜欢玩闹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_About_Gnolls_bb826e7c:

    # e "But, what do you plan to do to stop them, if you... intend to?"
    e "不过，如果你……打算阻止它们，你准备怎么做？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_About_Gnolls_98c3464f:

    # l "W-what? Uh... I... I have more important quests to take care of, disciple. They are mere nuisances to my heroic ventures."
    l "什、什么？呃……我……我还有更重要的任务要处理，门徒。它们不过是我英雄事业中的小麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Ask_About_Gnolls_1429c7ce:

    # e "Right..."
    e "好吧……"
